[[File:Busters.jpeg|thumb|350px]]
The term '''Busters''' can refer to a set of [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] events that combine almost every regular [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] with a specific target trait or ability into one set, or to the four units exclusive to them. Since the Busters sets are a form of "combination pool", their exclusive units cannot be obtained from [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] nor [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]], however a specific event was later added for them, called [[BUSTERFEST (Gacha Event)|BUSTERFEST]].

The [[Increasing Capsules Campaign|Step Up Campaign]] always appears during these events, but never the [[Guaranteed Uber Rare Cat Campaign]].

==List of Busters Events==
*[[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]]: Contains most of the regular [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] Ubers and an exclusive unit, [[Pai-Pai (Uber Rare Cat)|Pai-Pai]].
*[[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]]: Contains most of the regular [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] Ubers and an exclusive unit, [[Strike Unit R.E.I. (Uber Rare Cat)|Strike Unit R.E.I.]].
*[[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]]: Contains most of the regular [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal]] Ubers, all the [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]] variants and an exclusive unit, [[Sakura Sonic (Uber Rare Cat)|Sakura Sonic]].
*[[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]]: Contains most of the regular [[Wave Attack|wave]]-immune Ubers and an exclusive unit, [[Hell Warden Emma (Uber Rare Cat)|Hell Warden Emma]].
*[[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]]: Contains most of the regular [[:Category:Colossus Slayer Cats|Colossus Slayer]] Ubers and an exclusive unit, [[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Light Sirius]].

==Trivia==
*All of the Busters are female.
**During an official livestream on March 16th, 2018, it was confirmed that this was a deliberate choice.
*With the exception of Sakura Sonic, each Buster makes a different reference:
**Pai-Pai's name and design reference ''Magical Girl Chukana Paipai'', the ninth entry in the Toei Fushigi Comedy Series.
**Strike Unit R.E.I.'s attack animation resembles Gunbuster's Super Lightning Kick from the anime ''Gunbuster''. Both are also mechs.
**Hell Warden Emma's title references the manga ''Hell Warden Higuma''.
*Red Busters and Metal Busters were released without any exclusive units; this was not the case for Air Busters or Wave Busters.
*Pai-Pai and Strike Unit R.E.I. were added in the same updates as [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|River Styx]] and [[Honey Trap (Deadly)|Queen's Coronation]] respectively, as though they were designed specifically to counter those stages.
*Colossus Busters is the only Busters banner to not have its name be in all caps in BCEN. However, the name is fully capitalized in its second event poster.

